warning
# Issue #2739: a local lane record whose three-dot branch diff is empty
# (all content already on the base) finalized through the terminal merge
# bookkeeping without running review or the suite gate. Warning, not info:
# a record reaching this edge means work landed by another path -- exactly
# the shape that used to livelock -- so each fire is worth an operator's
# glance. The event fires only when the base advance completes (merged or
# already-contained), so it cannot repeat while a deferred advance holds
# the record non-terminal (review round 2): a deferral reports
# local_merge_deferred instead and the record retries the merge on a
# later pass without re-emitting this event.
